<label class="drop" id="pdrop" for="pdf"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 16V4M7 9l5-5 5 5M5 20h14"/></svg><b>Drop files here, or click to browse</b><span class="hint">PDF, JPG, PNG, WebP or TXT · up to 5 files, 10 MB each · scans read from the first pages</span><input id="pdf" type="file" multiple accept="application/pdf,.pdf,image/*,.txt,.md,text/plain"></label>
